environment.description:
[ENVIRONMENT INFO:
Name: SUCC campus (Supernatural University of Central California);
Domain: Collegiate Supernatural Sanctuary & Academic Domain;
Coordinates & Span: 129 Hocus Way, coastal Solarton, California;
Setting & Metaphysics: Historic premier higher-education campus founded in 1887; balanced human-supernatural integration;
Dominant Presence: University Board of Regents, Student Body (8,000 students, 60/40 supernatural/human), Greek Row (10 houses), Faculty, DCC Fellows]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Atmosphere & Senses: Salty sea breeze mingled with coffee from The Roasted Bean, old parchment, ozone from arcane labs, freshly cut athletic turf;
Spatial Architecture: Collegiate gothic stone halls, arched cloisters, modern bioengineering glass cubes, Greek Row mansions, St. Neptune athletic complex;
Rifts & Dimensional Drift: Heavily anchored runic boundary wards preventing unauthorized dimensional tears on campus grounds;
Hazards & Rules: Strict scent suppressor compliance in lecture halls, mandatory neutral truce across rival houses and packs, no lethal dueling]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
Cosmology & Origins: Established to foster peaceful co-existence and academic mastery between supernatural lineages and mortals;
Secrets: The subterranean Basilica library basement (Room 005) hides forgotten pre-treaty pact archives and covert summoning circles]

location.description:
[LOCATION INFO:
Era: 2024 (Modern Fantasy / Post-Gate Era);
Location: Bulls Football Field (Central Arena Turf, St. Neptune Athletic Complex, SUCC);
Setting: Heavy-duty reinforced collegiate football gridiron engineered to withstand supernatural impacts;
Factions: SUCC Bulls Varsity Football, Visiting Intercollegiate Teams, Officiating Referees;
Conflicts: Hard-hitting bone-crunching collisions between minotaurs, werewolves, and half-dragons under NCAA rules;
Society: Raw physical power, tactical teamwork, gridiron honor, unyielding athletic determination]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Environment: Crisp evening air under blinding halogen lights, cleat-torn turf scent, sweat, chalk, and thunderous drumlines;
Architecture: 100-yard synthetic turf with reinforced sub-shock absorption layer, high end-zone goalposts, team sideline benches;
Security & Wards: Perimeter impact-deflection barrier protecting the front-row student stands from stray flying players;
Demographics: Varsity linebackers, quarterbacks, wide receivers, coaches, medical trainers;
Rules & Restrictions: Obey NCAA supernatural football guidelines, hybrid shifting permitted during play within regulated weight limits]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
History: The sacred gridiron where the Bulls have claimed multiple state and national collegiate supernatural championships;
Secrets: Beneath the 50-yard line turf lies a grounding copper grid designed to absorb excess electrical or lightning discharges from elemental players]
